{"workflow":{"id":22156,"name":"Find new Swiss B2B leads from SHAB using Apify, Google Sheets and Gmail","views":0,"recentViews":0,"totalViews":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-31T18:19:20.085Z","description":"## Quick Overview\nThis workflow runs every weekday morning, pulls newly published Swiss commercial register (SHAB HR01) company entries via an Apify actor, filters them into qualified leads, stores only unseen companies in Google Sheets, and emails a daily HTML summary through Gmail.\n\n## How it works\n1. Runs every weekday at 07:00 on a schedule.\n2. Sends a request to an Apify actor to fetch recent SHAB HR01 “new companies” notices for the configured cantons and lookback window.\n3. Filters the results to the allowed legal forms and applies include/exclude keyword matching against the company name and purpose.\n4. Reads existing leads from Google Sheets and removes any companies whose UID is already present to avoid duplicates.\n5. Appends the remaining new companies to the Google Sheets “Leads” tab.\n6. Builds an HTML email containing a table of the new companies and sends it to the configured recipient via Gmail.\n7. If the Apify request fails, sends a failure alert email via Gmail instead of silently producing no results.\n\n## Setup\n1. Create an Apify account, add an HTTP Header Auth credential in n8n with `Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`, and select it on the Apify HTTP request step.\n2. Connect Google Sheets OAuth credentials and create a spreadsheet with a `Leads` tab and columns for at least: uid, name, legal_form, seat, canton, address, purpose, matched_keywords, published, shab_url.\n3. Update the configuration values for cantons, legal form codes, keyword filters, lookbackDays/maxItems, and set your Google Sheets URL, tab name, and notification email.\n4. Connect Gmail OAuth credentials for sending the summary and failure-alert emails, then run the workflow once to verify rows append correctly and the email formatting looks right.","workflow":{"meta":{"templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"Find new Swiss companies from the Zefix and SHAB register as qualified B2B leads","nodes":[{"id":"fe4c00f0-78c4-5218-be94-77241470663c","name":"Note 1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-600,40],"parameters":{"width":520,"height":640,"content":"### How it works\nThis workflow helps Swiss agencies, accountants, insurers and B2B sales teams reach new companies in their first days. Every weekday it fetches new commercial register entries (SHAB rubric HR01, the same data as Zefix) for your cantons through an Apify actor. It keeps the legal forms you want, applies your include and exclude keywords to the name and company purpose, and skips every company already in your Google Sheet. New companies are added to the sheet and you get one email summary. Days without a match send nothing. A failed Apify run sends an alert.\n\n### Setup\nYou need an Apify account (the free plan works, the actor charges per record), Google Sheets and Gmail.\n1. Create a Header Auth credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Create a sheet with a tab named `Leads` and these columns in row 1: uid, name, legal_form, seat, canton, address, purpose, matched_keywords, published, shab_url.\n3. Fill in the Configuration node: cantons, sheet URL, tab name, your email.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail, run once and check the sheet.\n\n### Customization\nLegal form codes: 0106 AG, 0107 GmbH, 0101 sole proprietorship. Leave includeKeywords empty to keep all companies. Publication takes a few days after founding, so lookbackDays covers weekends."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"41861d4f-97ca-5dc7-a3f1-be85231f42ad","name":"Note 2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-40,180],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":600,"height":300,"content":"## Fetch new registrations\nLoads the settings and asks Apify for fresh HR01 notices from the Swiss Official Gazette of Commerce."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f9e6e544-7a84-5373-b4f4-b8cfdffc5607","name":"Note 3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[620,180],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":600,"height":300,"content":"## Keep real leads\nDrops other legal forms and excluded words, then removes every company already in your sheet."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"10c278ae-3ca1-57c0-ac8d-71f0d4bec983","name":"Note 4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1260,180],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":620,"height":300,"content":"## Save and notify\nAdds new companies to the sheet, then emails one summary. No new company means no email."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"52aa26d8-a34e-583a-b849-f1b31108a3b5","name":"Note 5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[460,500],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":520,"height":240,"content":"## Failed Apify run\nA bad token, no credit or a timeout lands here, so a silent gap in your lead list cannot happen."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b18482d4-bf16-586f-a2f3-7a2e21d3638d","name":"Every weekday at 07:00","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[0,300],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"cronExpression","expression":"0 7 * * 1-5"}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"c767ba79-9ad2-55cd-b227-f148292e88ba","name":"Configuration","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[220,300],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"7c51e134-1e93-5f58-9671-6848e80ba049","name":"cantons","type":"string","value":"ZH,ZG"},{"id":"586816b7-b767-507b-b4f3-dc952f1cdb6b","name":"legalFormCodes","type":"string","value":"0106,0107"},{"id":"4c3a3e6a-3740-598c-a9b4-971e1906e11a","name":"includeKeywords","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"38ef6075-7926-59ae-b3e3-d83b1ef787df","name":"excludeKeywords","type":"string","value":"holding,immobilien"},{"id":"2032990a-3d05-5508-8127-61f0791446bd","name":"lookbackDays","type":"number","value":4},{"id":"7c71c24a-ef7d-5fbc-8e33-356af5418d2d","name":"maxItems","type":"number","value":500},{"id":"2de62aaf-a9be-5fd6-a708-33528684e3d1","name":"sheetUrl","type":"string","value":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit"},{"id":"82cff252-06e7-57b0-ab45-6bb02ab1fea1","name":"sheetTab","type":"string","value":"Leads"},{"id":"7b0a4e70-dc62-55df-9263-36bfda46fab5","name":"notifyEmail","type":"string","value":"you@example.com"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"f6c7fac3-5ca2-5205-82a0-22a05cfa1053","name":"Fetch new registrations from SHAB","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[440,300],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/swissalpinedata~swiss-company-register-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items","method":"POST","options":{"timeout":300000},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ mode: \"new-companies\", cantons: $json.cantons.split(\",\").map((c) => c.trim().toUpperCase()).filter(Boolean), subRubrics: [\"HR01\"], dateFrom: $today.minus({ days: Number($json.lookbackDays) }).toFormat(\"yyyy-MM-dd\"), maxItems: Number($json.maxItems) }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth"},"credentials":{"httpHeaderAuth":{"id":"","name":"Apify API token"}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"7488de5e-3386-540f-9200-ab42b853b8d6","name":"Match target profile","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[660,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const list = (s) => String(s ?? '').split(',').map((x) => x.trim().toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean);\nconst c = $('Configuration').first().json;\nconst codes = list(c.legalFormCodes);\nconst include = list(c.includeKeywords);\nconst exclude = list(c.excludeKeywords);\n\nconst rows = [];\nfor (const { json: r } of $input.all()) {\n  const text = `${r.name ?? ''} ${r.purpose ?? ''}`.toLowerCase();\n  if (codes.length && !codes.includes(String(r.legal_form_code))) continue;\n  if (exclude.some((w) => text.includes(w))) continue;\n  const hits = include.filter((w) => text.includes(w));\n  if (include.length && !hits.length) continue;\n  rows.push({\n    json: {\n      uid: r.uid,\n      name: r.name,\n      legal_form: r.legal_form,\n      seat: r.seat,\n      canton: r.canton,\n      address: r.address ?? '',\n      purpose: r.purpose ?? '',\n      matched_keywords: hits.join(', '),\n      published: r.publication_date,\n      shab_url: r.url,\n    },\n  });\n}\nreturn rows;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"6b4ab6bd-56c6-5d63-ad79-aff5077c2262","name":"Read companies already in sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[880,300],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Configuration').first().json.sheetTab }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Configuration').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"e20a7612-29f6-5a54-bad4-cff739078144","name":"Keep only new companies","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1100,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Rows already in the sheet are skipped, so the overlapping date window never adds a company twice.\nconst known = new Set($input.all().map((i) => String(i.json.uid ?? '')).filter(Boolean));\nconst fresh = [];\nfor (const item of $('Match target profile').all()) {\n  if (known.has(item.json.uid)) continue;\n  known.add(item.json.uid);\n  fresh.push({ json: item.json });\n}\nreturn fresh;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a4b15137-a4be-521b-9e1b-b259a774aad5","name":"Add new companies to sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1320,300],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData"},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Configuration').first().json.sheetTab }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Configuration').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"b9b0368d-033c-50e0-bd75-7251804e5d35","name":"Build email summary","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1540,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const esc = (s) => String(s ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst rows = $('Keep only new companies').all().map((i) => i.json);\nconst trs = rows.map((r) => `<tr><td><a href=\"${esc(r.shab_url)}\">${esc(r.name)}</a></td><td>${esc(r.legal_form)}</td>` +\n  `<td>${esc(r.seat)}</td><td>${esc(r.purpose.slice(0, 160))}</td></tr>`).join('');\nconst html = `<p>New companies for your profile: ${rows.length}</p>` +\n  `<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><th>Company</th><th>Legal form</th><th>Seat</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>${trs}</table>`;\nreturn [{ json: { count: rows.length, html } }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"22c71d7b-7938-5d55-8fac-105f458d0146","name":"Email the new leads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1760,300],"parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('Configuration').first().json.notifyEmail }}","message":"={{ $json.html }}","options":{"appendAttribution":false},"subject":"=New Swiss companies for your profile: {{ $json.count }}","resource":"message","emailType":"html","operation":"send"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"","name":"Gmail account"}},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"a35c9231-c1ff-5cd9-bf9d-a029e5726436","name":"Alert on failed Apify run","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[660,600],"parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('Configuration').first().json.notifyEmail }}","message":"=<p>The Apify run failed, so this run produced no result.</p><p>{{ $json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'Unknown error' }}</p><p>Check the Apify token and the run log at https://console.apify.com/actors/runs</p>","options":{"appendAttribution":false},"subject":"New Swiss companies workflow failed","resource":"message","emailType":"html","operation":"send"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"","name":"Gmail account"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":2.1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"Configuration":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch new registrations from SHAB","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build email summary":{"main":[[{"node":"Email the new leads","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Match target profile":{"main":[[{"node":"Read companies already in sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Every weekday at 07:00":{"main":[[{"node":"Configuration","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Keep only new companies":{"main":[[{"node":"Add new companies to sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Add new companies to sheet":{"main":[[{"node":"Build email summary","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read companies already in sheet":{"main":[[{"node":"Keep only new companies","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch new registrations from SHAB":{"main":[[{"node":"Match target profile","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Alert on failed Apify run","type":"main","index":0}]]}}},"lastUpdatedBy":1,"workflowInfo":{"nodeCount":15,"nodeTypes":{"n8n-nodes-base.set":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.code":{"count":3},"n8n-nodes-base.gmail":{"count":2},"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote":{"count":5},"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets":{"count":2},"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger":{"count":1}}},"status":"published","reviewStatus":"published","readyToDemo":null,"user":{"name":"Swiss Alpine Data","username":"swissalpinedata","bio":"","verified":false,"links":[],"avatar":"https://gravatar.com/avatar/ca64721353d24c11877fd8314701e62778a0f7d5f3968e118be5a3dd48903f4b?r=pg&d=retro&size=200"},"nodes":[{"id":18,"icon":"file:googleSheets.svg","name":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","codex":{"data":{"alias":["CSV","Sheet","Spreadsheet","GS"],"resources":{"generic":[{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/love-at-first-sight-ricardos-n8n-journey/","icon":"❤️","label":"Love at first sight: Ricardo’s n8n journey"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/why-business-process-automation-with-n8n-can-change-your-daily-life/","icon":"🧬","label":"Why business process automation with n8n can change your daily life"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/b